{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act51side_level_act51side_st02","storyGroup":"act51side","storySort":18,"storyDependence":"act51side_level_act51side_08_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PA-ST-2","storyName":"完整的缺损","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"听证会的所有流程全部结束，整个事件背后的真相也随之揭晓。乌萨斯学生自治团设法救出了其他被关押的学生，她们也重新团聚在了一起。安托沙悼念逝去的友人，跟上了工人的队伍。此时，第一集团军的新型武器即将投放试验，阴云再次笼罩乌萨斯。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act51side/level_act51side_st02","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act51side_st02","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":16,"characters":["仲裁人","苦艾","焦虑的贵族","乌萨斯警察","积极的学生","拉列亚","匆忙的学生","烈夏","凛冬","真理","古米","早露","弑君者","安托沙","谨慎的工人","兴奋的工人","？？？","休息的工人","“马特维”","爽朗的工人","尼克托","紧张的军官","严肃的军官","威严的军人"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_bg_66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$sjoyasorrow_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_sjoyasorrow_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"肃静。","id":11,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"诸位，所有证人均已陈述完毕，相信诸位大人已从各方证词中得到了线索。","id":12,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"鉴于“卡托加事件”牵涉甚广，且证词存在诸多矛盾......","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"仲裁委员会需要时间对所有证据进行“闭门核查”。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"现在宣布听证会流程到此结束。两小时后，我们将正式公布“卡托加事件”的最终审议结果。","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$1","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"......","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#7$1","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"（压低声音）是时候了。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":20},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_outside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":21},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":22},{"type":"text","text":"七嘴八舌的讨论又一次在她四周响起，几位贵族不出所料地与仲裁人同行，走向厅内的过道。","id":23},{"type":"text","text":"苦艾摇了摇头，穿过熙熙攘攘的人群，走出门时，她回头对上书记官的目光。","id":24},{"type":"text","text":"书记官面无表情，视线仿佛穿透了她，落在虚无的空气中。但他不动声色地竖起了手中的记录本——","id":25},{"type":"text","text":"那上面一片雪白，空无一字。","id":26},{"type":"dialog","id":27},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":28},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":29},{"type":"charslot","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":31},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_bg_72_g10_hallway.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":32},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":33},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":34},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":35},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"呼......真是场漫长的闹剧。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"难以置信，连特里波列夫家的小孩都会犯错。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2171_1#1$1","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦虑的贵族","text":"不过，重点还是在索尼娅身上，仲裁人阁下，您打算怎么定性？","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"这取决于我们需要她成为什么样的“反面教材”。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2171_1#1$1","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦虑的贵族","text":"我们需要她是一个疯子，阁下。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦虑的贵族","text":"有的新贵族试图利用皇帝陛下狡辩，连“勤王护驾有功”这种鬼话都讲得出口。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦虑的贵族","text":"必须得放大索尼娅的危害性，不趁这个机会收拾那些暴发户，将来他们会变本加厉地颠倒黑白！","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2171_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"......等特里波列夫公爵到了再一起决定，他还需要一些时间平复心情。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":50},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crwddiscuss_inside","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":51},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.2","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"等等......","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"这是什么声音？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":57},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":58},{"type":"charslot","id":59},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":60},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/93/Avg_bg_66_g12_deitygrypherburgmeeting.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":61},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.4","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":62},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2170_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":64},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯警察","text":"仲裁人阁下！","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2170_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"发生什么事了？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2170_1#1$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯警察","text":"有消息说，有一群歹徒突袭了三号监狱，劫走了许多犯人。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2170_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯警察","text":"因为这个事情，刚才大家都吵翻了，需要您来主持秩序。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2170_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"三号监狱这么随便就被突破了？","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2170_1#1$1","id":74},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯警察","text":"我们的警力都集中在这附近，余下的人不够提前发现那些歹徒，才导致了这一失误。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2170_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"......不对。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"外面的学生呢？","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2170_1#1$1","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯警察","text":"他们刚刚都解散回家了，您的意思是......","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2170_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2168_1#1$1","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"......","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"仲裁人","text":"我的意思是，你们这些废物！赶紧找出带头的，把他抓回来！","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D0/Avg_avg_npc_2168_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2170_1#1$1","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"乌萨斯警察","text":"是！","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1E/Avg_avg_npc_2170_1$1.png"},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":86},{"type":"dialog","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":88},{"type":"charslot","id":89},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":90},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_bg_bg_cellroom_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":91},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_key","id":93},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2179_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":95},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"积极的学生","text":"喂，醒醒！","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_2179_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"charslot","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2176_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉列亚","text":"......你是？","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2176_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2179_1#1$1","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"积极的学生","text":"你就是拉列亚吧，这座监狱已经被我们攻占了。","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_2179_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"积极的学生","text":"趁他们的援军还没赶到，赶紧离开这里。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_2179_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2176_1#1$1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉列亚","text":"我没有弄错吧......你们是来救我的吗？","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2176_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2179_1#1$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"积极的学生","text":"当然不止是你，你先出来。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_2179_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"惊喜与困意交织，拉列亚顶着发懵的脑袋，一步步地跨过倒在地上的狱警。","id":111},{"type":"text","text":"他的思绪飘荡，原来自己的威望已然如此......他要回到学生联合大会，成为不亚于奥尔佳的领袖角色。","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2176_1#1$1","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉列亚","text":"同学们......我的同胞们！","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2176_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉列亚","text":"看着你们，我就知道，自由的火种从未熄灭！","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2176_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2179_1#1$1","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"积极的学生","text":"二队！二队把缺口守住！这边的牢房都打开了！","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_2179_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2176_1#1$1","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉列亚","text":"咳咳——","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2176_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉列亚","text":"正如你们所见，虽然这漆黑的牢笼禁锢了我的肉体，但它无法禁锢我的——","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2176_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2182_1#1$1","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"0.5","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":124},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"r","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的学生","text":"借过！别挡道！","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4D/Avg_avg_npc_2182_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":127},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-250,0","duration":"0.81","afrom":"1","ato":"0","focus":"r","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2176_1#1$1","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉列亚","text":"......没关系。","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2176_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉列亚","text":"我知道，你们是为了我而来的。为了——","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C6/Avg_avg_npc_2176_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":133},{"type":"text","text":"没有一个人回应他......他看着面前眼熟的各个身影，却发觉这群昔日的同学不知何时已经变得陌生。","id":134},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":135},{"type":"dialog","id":136},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":137},{"type":"charslot","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B9/Avg_bg_72_g1_sjbstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":140},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":142},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":143,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"啊啊，累死我了。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"我刚从那鬼地方跑出来，又要和你们干这一票。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"别抱怨了，卓娅都没说什么呢。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#4$1","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"索尼娅，你的想法一直都这么大胆吗？","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"没想到我们居然真的能在那些人的眼皮子底下玩出这套......","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#1$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"卓娅，先前你主动提出要出席听证会拖延时间，我们还担心了好久。","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3B/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"本来娜塔莉娅都找人安排好了，不用让你去冒这么大风险。","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3B/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$1","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"古米本来也不用全程参与行动的，可她还是来了。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#4$1","id":158},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"哼，说到这个......","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0E/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#19$1","id":160},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"凛冬姐——","id":161,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"我已经道过歉啦！而且，我不也没怎么受伤吗？真理姐还说我有帮上忙，你不能再骂我了。","id":162,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/76/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","id":163},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"谁说我要骂你了？","id":164,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"如果不是你和坚雷教官，还有......弑君者，之前闯出封锁区的时候，我们还得分出精力提防来自动力层的袭击。你们确实帮上了忙。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#1$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"冬将军承认了呀。就像如果不是卓娅主动去听证会把这场戏演足，或许今天也不会有这么顺利的结果。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"我们不会把任何人排除在外了。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"我没有想把她们排除在外......算了，事实证明这确实是我计划上的疏漏。","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"不过我更没想到，再见到你们的时候，外面原本各行其是的学生，已经变成了一支紧密的队伍。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"也辛苦你了，真理。","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#2$1","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"还不是因为你太莽撞了，我只能这样......","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#1$1","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"好啦，索尼娅，安娜，我们都该想想下一步的事了。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/86/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#1$2","id":177},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"啊，对。我们出发之前，坚雷教官说罗德岛准备好了安全屋，让我们结束后不要回办事处，直接过去。","id":178,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#5$1","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"说是要先......“避避风头”？","id":180,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2E/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#1$1","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"之后在圣骏堡，我们只能隐秘行动了。所幸学校那边我已经安排好了，接收情报还是没问题的。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3B/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"那就走啊。","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#1$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"嗯。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3B/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#1$1","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"走！","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"哦，等等。","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"卓娅，你是不是忘了什么？","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#4$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"什么？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/21/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"看着凛冬疑惑的目光，她意识到了什么，从包里拿出了一个铁徽章——握紧的拳头的图案，还是崭新的。","id":195},{"type":"charslot","id":196},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"嗯，你带着呢。之后要好好戴在身上啊。","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"你以前就该是我们的一员，现在和以后，更加得是。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#8$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"凛冬，你们......","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A2/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#8$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"嘿嘿卓娅，以后可有你受的了。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#5$1","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"冬将军看起来嘻嘻哈哈，以前自己也不乐意戴这东西。但现在你要是被她逮到几次忘戴徽章，她那个脸色可——","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0B/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#10$1","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"......别说了，不是还要避风头吗！","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":211},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_bg_49_g13_smallroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":214},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"这地方七弯八拐的，真不好找。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$1","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"大概是为了保证安全性。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#5$1","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"是啊。之前你们在其他城市里活动的时候，卓娅和我每周都要换一个像这样的新据点，才好继续接收情报，准备下一步的行动。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9B/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#1$1","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"反正我是干不了这种活的，换成其他时候，让我在这待两天就得无聊死。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_405_absin_1#1$1","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"苦艾","text":"其实也没那么枯燥。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_405_absin_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#1$1","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"是罗莎琳自己坐不住。","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3B/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_194_leto_1#6$1","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"烈夏","text":"欸——","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6F/Avg_avg_194_leto_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":231},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":232},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"你们来了。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#6$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"啊。难道这里其实是你的安全屋？","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B1/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"就当作是罗德岛的吧。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2156_1#6$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"真理","text":"索尼娅，她是......？","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_npc_2156_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"弑君者，柳德米拉。她和我们一样，也是圣骏堡办事处的派驻干员。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"（点头）","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_197_poca_1#8$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"早露","text":"......","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F1/Avg_avg_197_poca_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#1$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"她们看上去都不认识你。看来就算我专门找你说了，你也还是没往心里去啊。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":249},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"罗德岛在乌萨斯的资源尚且有限，最好先留给更需要的人。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"而且，我找过办事处，古米帮了我。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#1$2","id":252},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"我觉得那算是互相帮助！","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1051_headb2_1#2$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凛冬","text":"好吧。有个开头总比没有好。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BE/Avg_avg_1051_headb2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"总之，你们可以在这里待一段时间，等风头过去，坚雷会来通知你们。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#3$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"嗯？那你呢？","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"我要离开圣骏堡一段时间。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"正在追踪的任务有了重要进展，我现在必须先尽快去那边核实情况。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":263},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"charslot","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":267},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_bg_72_g15_wideunder.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":270},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$distressed_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_distressed_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":271,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","duration":"0.5","id":272},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":276},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":277},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......古米......","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":282},{"type":"charslot","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1","duration":"1","id":284},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"唔。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"为什么要跟着我？快回去。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"你要去爸爸在通讯里提到的那个地方，对不对？","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"这是我的任务。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"可是......","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"可那里有古米的爸爸。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"我甚至还没有确定他说的具体是哪个卫星城，跟着我，不一定能见到你父亲。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"这与任务危险与否无关，只是现在你没有必要——","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"柳德米拉姐。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"嗯？","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#15$1","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"如果你找到了那个卫星城，见到了我爸爸，或者我妈妈，你会告诉我吗？","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"我会。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"好。那我还有最后一个问题。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"早露姐刚才说，你以前是整合运动的人。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"她说的是真的。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#21$1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"可是凛冬姐说这不重要，烈夏姐说她本来也不打算和你有什么接触。","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"真理姐和苦艾姐都沉默了，古米心里也有自己的看法。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/85/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-21$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"那时候，你不在那里，对不对？","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"你不在彼得海姆。","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C0/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":322},{"type":"text","text":"红发的青年女性沉默了。黑暗中，她握紧了双拳，而后又伸展开去。","id":323},{"type":"text","text":"她望着女孩恳切的双眼，最终缓缓、缓缓地摇了摇头。","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"可我在切尔诺伯格。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"我曾经是那个整合运动的一员，无论它产生的邪恶是否曾真的经过我的双手，我都需要与它共同承担罪责。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"逃避毫无用处。因此，我不奢求原谅或是和解。只是现在，这一次，至少这一次......","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"如果我还有挽回些什么的机会，那我一定要去做。","id":331,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EA/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":332},{"type":"text","text":"古米睁大了眼睛，似乎在思考着弑君者的发言。很快，她又微笑起来，从口袋里掏出一颗蜂蜜糖。","id":333},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":334},{"type":"text","text":"隔着手套，她把糖塞进弑君者的掌心里。","id":335},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"弑君者","text":"......这是什么——","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#11$1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"这是约定。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"我明白凛冬姐为什么说不重要了。我们已经长大，长大到即使选择不去迁怒和怨恨，也能获得内心的平静。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_196_sunbr_1#3$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"我会等你回来，等你带着爸爸的消息，或者妈妈的消息——甚至是他们两个人的消息，回来！","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"古米","text":"我想相信。我想相信可靠的柳德米拉姐。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_196_sunbr_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":344},{"type":"dialog","id":345},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":346},{"type":"charslot","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":348},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B9/Avg_bg_72_g1_sjbstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"第二天，我回到了那条街道，一个人。","id":350},{"type":"dialog","id":351},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":352},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":353},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":354,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":355},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":356},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的工人","text":"喂喂，注意一下，这可是议员派的活儿，要是磕坏了东西——","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"r","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的工人","text":"但是你看到了吗？那个混蛋巴普洛维奇，就是在那片封锁区里被砸成了馅饼。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的工人","text":"说不定之前，我们人人都踩了一脚他的尸体呢！","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谨慎的工人","text":"小点声！这里可不都是我们的人。","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"r","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的工人","text":"嗐，怎么可能有别人嘛，我们都在——","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"dialog","id":368},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$2","duration":"1","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"......","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"兴奋的工人","text":"您，您是？","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#2$2","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"我是来找人的，不打扰你们工作。如果你担心我会出卖你——","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/32/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#1$2","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"巴普洛维奇死有余辜。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":378},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"安托沙向对方微微鞠躬，他穿过工人们的队伍，走到街道的对面，走向记忆中的门楣。","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"被学校开除的时候，马特维将身无分文的他带回了家里，那是他自从来到圣骏堡后，第一次有了和家人吃饭的感觉。","id":381},{"type":"text","text":"他还记得马特维的母亲，总是安静地微笑，搅动着红菜汤里为数不多的肉块，偷偷盛进他的碗中。","id":382},{"type":"charslot","id":383},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#11$2","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"我......","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":386},{"type":"text","text":"他抬起头，是熟悉的甜菜与洋葱的味道。","id":387},{"type":"text","text":"窗帘没有拉严，昏黄的灯光透了出来，他不禁朝着屋里看去。","id":388},{"type":"text","text":"一位年迈的女士，从狭窄的厨房里捧出了一个陶罐，舀出红菜汤，分到了三个不同的碗里。","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#6$2","id":390},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"三份......？！","id":391,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#3$2","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"那是留给我的——","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#11$2","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"你在信里到底写了什么......","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-11$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"嗯？外面有人吗？","id":397},{"type":"dialog","id":398},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":399},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":400},{"type":"dialog","id":401},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":402},{"type":"text","text":"听到屋里的声音，他像是最卑劣的窃贼，拿出为马特维所写的讣告，夹在了窗户的边缘，转身逃开。","id":403},{"type":"dialog","id":404},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#1$2","id":405},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"（压低声音）该死！","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"（压低声音）什么时候变得这么软弱了，安托沙！","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/29/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":409},{"type":"charslot","id":410},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_carriage_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":411},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":413},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休息的工人","text":"年轻人，别跑那么急，让一让。","id":414},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2157_1#3$2","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"......","id":416,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_avg_npc_2157_1-3$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"休息的工人","text":"驮兽有点累了，搬点旧家具也不容易，嘿嘿。","id":418},{"type":"text","text":"安托沙点点头，他侧过了身子。","id":419},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":420},{"type":"dialog","id":421},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":422},{"type":"charslot","id":423},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":424},{"type":"background","id":425},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_72_i15_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":426},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":427},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":428},{"type":"dialog","id":429},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$storyendjp_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_avg_storyendjp_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":430,"musicid":4},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_072cg_snowcoverwindow","layer":"1","id":431},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":432},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CF/Avg_72_i15_3.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":433},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":434},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"马特维？！","id":435},{"type":"text","text":"驮车上的镜子，映着灰暗的街道、狼狈的自己、属于过去的身影。","id":436},{"type":"text","text":"阳光铺满了马特维的脸庞。他是那么地真实、鲜活，没有不甘的表情和被灰尘沾染的伤口，只是胸膛上插着一束樱桃花......","id":437},{"type":"text","text":"鲜血的颜色，从花蕊到花瓣，渐渐晕散。","id":438},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"是你吗，朋友？","id":439},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"我明明看见你，看见利斯特、尤拉......我......","id":440},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"我记得每个人的死亡，记得你们每一句祈祷与告别，还有那些没能留下遗言的人。","id":441},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"你会告诉我，这一切都是虚假的，对吗？","id":442},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“马特维”","text":"......不，安托沙。","id":443},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"？！","id":444},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“马特维”","text":"你有没有想象过，我本该会过上的人生。","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“马特维”","text":"我还会留在校园里，遇上更多值得交往的朋友，在春天的河流边写下今年的第一首诗。","id":446},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“马特维”","text":"下午没课的时候，我会回到家里，等着母亲炖好汤，我会念起写给她的文章。","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“马特维”","text":"她肯定听不懂，但是会眯起眼睛，笑着和我说：“多吃点，我亲爱的大学生。”","id":448},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"啊......","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"马特维，马特维，我......","id":450},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"为什么是，我活着......","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“马特维”","text":"因为，你还有机会，过上我想过的人生。","id":452},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“马特维”","text":"放下吧安托沙，我知道，你到底背负着担子走了多少年。","id":453},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"过上那样美好的人生......我真的可以吗？","id":454},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"......每一个乌萨斯人都可以吗？","id":455},{"type":"multiline","name":"安托沙","text":"马特维，如果我没有选择反抗这片充满压迫的大地，","id":456},{"type":"multiline","name":"安托沙","text":"我还会和你成为朋友吗......","id":457},{"type":"text","text":"过去的身影没有回答，只是轻轻发出一声叹息。","id":458},{"type":"dialog","id":459},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_72_i15_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":460},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":461},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":462},{"type":"charslot","id":463},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.22","id":464},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.22","id":465},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_72_i15_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.6","yScale":"1.6","x":"150","y":"-200","id":466},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":467},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":468},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_72_i15_4.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","xScale":"1.6","yScale":"1.6","x":"150","y":"-200","id":469},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":470},{"type":"text","text":"离开故乡后，安托沙第二次流下了眼泪。","id":471},{"type":"text","text":"他活着，但他的一部分灵魂，永远留在了卡托加区的废墟下。","id":472},{"type":"dialog","id":473},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":474},{"type":"charslot","id":475},{"type":"curtain","id":476},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_72_i15_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":477},{"type":"delay","time":"0.25","id":478},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":479},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"活下去......","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"如果现在放弃了，马特维就永远是帝国贵族口中的叛徒。","id":481},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"会有那么一天，我会把他和老师，把无缚者同盟的大家，都刻在属于烈士的石碑上......","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安托沙","text":"再给我一些时间吧，我的朋友。","id":483},{"type":"dialog","id":484},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":485},{"type":"curtain","id":486},{"type":"image","id":487},{"type":"text","text":"他用满是尘土与污垢的袖子，抹过了自己的眼睛。","id":488},{"type":"text","text":"随后他抬起步子，跟在了工人队伍的最后。","id":489},{"type":"dialog","id":490},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":491},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B9/Avg_bg_72_g1_sjbstreet_d.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":492},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":493},{"type":"text","text":"在这工人队伍的另一头，一个年轻人望着这座陌生的城市，甚至没发觉自己扛在肩上的箱子已滑落于地。","id":494},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","id":495},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爽朗的工人","text":"喂，兄弟！","id":496,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爽朗的工人","text":"看什么呢这么认真？也让我们看看。","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":498},{"type":"charslot","id":499},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2185_1#4$1","duration":"0.5","id":500},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":501},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尼克托","text":"我好像......不，没什么。","id":502,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AD/Avg_avg_npc_2185_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1979_1#1$1","id":503},{"type":"dialogue","name":"爽朗的工人","text":"你来我们这里也几天了，别那么拘谨嘛，开心点，我们都进圣骏堡啦。","id":504,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_1979_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2185_1#1$1","id":505},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尼克托","text":"圣骏堡......","id":506,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AF/Avg_avg_npc_2185_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2185_1#10$1","id":507},{"type":"dialogue","name":"尼克托","text":"你说得没错，到圣骏堡的这一路，可真是难熬......","id":508,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C7/Avg_avg_npc_2185_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":509},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":510},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":511},{"type":"text","text":"天光逐渐消散，像是拉上了帷幕。","id":512},{"type":"dialog","id":513},{"type":"charslot","id":514},{"type":"image","id":515},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":516},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_bg_50_g13_warshipcommandroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":517},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":518},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":519},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$suspenseful_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_suspenseful_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":520,"musicid":5},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":521},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":522},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":523},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":524},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的军官","text":"元帅把我们召集到这里，又是要做什么？","id":525,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的军官","text":"难道因为那小子遇刺，砍了他所有亲卫的脑袋都不够，还要追责到我们头上来吗？","id":526,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"r","id":527},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的军官","text":"也可能是你想多了，只是又有预料外的紧急情况。","id":528,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的军官","text":"毕竟，即使半个月前军中爆发了小规模叛乱，从整体战况来看，第四集团军仍然与第二集团军相持不下。","id":529,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":530},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的军官","text":"你的意思是？","id":531,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"r","id":532},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的军官","text":"只是猜测，但或许，我们也没法再独善其身了。","id":533,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","focus":"l","id":534},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的军官","text":"可第一集团军向来都是——","id":535,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":536},{"type":"charslot","id":537},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_armyboots_walk","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","id":538},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":539},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0","id":540},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"向来都是？","id":541},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":542},{"type":"dialogue","name":"紧张的军官","text":"......向来都是独、独立于派系之外的编制。我们不主动参与任何斗争，只维护乌萨斯的利益。","id":543,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":544},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"没错。","id":545},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"既然是这样，各位又在忧心什么呢？","id":546},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":547},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的军官","text":"请恕我直言，总司令。您突然将我们从各自的驻地召集至此，一定有足够重要的缘由。","id":548,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":549},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"当然。","id":550},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1977_1#1$1","id":551},{"type":"dialogue","name":"严肃的军官","text":"那么这个缘由是......？","id":552,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C5/Avg_avg_npc_1977_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":553},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"我们的新型武器已经通过了理论测算阶段，可以投放试验。","id":554},{"type":"dialogue","name":"威严的军人","text":"我需要各军团配合，“悄无声息”地完成这场试爆。","id":555},{"type":"dialog","id":556},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":557},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":558},{"type":"bgeffect","id":559},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":560},{"type":"hidecgitem","id":561},{"type":"image","id":562},{"type":"charslot","text":"","id":563}],"characters":["仲裁人","苦艾","焦虑的贵族","乌萨斯警察","积极的学生","拉列亚","匆忙的学生","烈夏","凛冬","真理","古米","早露","弑君者","安托沙","谨慎的工人","兴奋的工人","？？？","休息的工人","“马特维”","爽朗的工人","尼克托","紧张的军官","严肃的军官","威严的军人"]}